## ❓ What is Nmap?
Nmap (Network Mapper) is a tool used to scan networks and find open ports and services.

## 🔍 Why Network Scanning Matters?
- Helps identify open ports
- Detects running services
- Finds possible security risks

## ⚖️ Ethical Guidelines
- Only scan your own system or authorized networks
- Do not scan unknown targets

